          "text": "RETOUCH BRIEF \u2014 edit before running.\nSubject: bicycle frame\nDestination plate: beach at low tide (night key)\nKeep: product geometry, colourway, label text\nChange: background, lighting direction, contact shadow, grade\nOutput: relit composite, upscaled, ready for catalogue use."
